{"body":{"text":["The session measured and found a fault: the brief component asked for each brief stopping at the briefs within it, but passed the stop behind a placeholder the engine now matches by type, so the stop fell away silently and every brief read its whole subtree, The design 15,501 holons and 2.6 MB of JSON, its 65 sections 52,379 more; called rightly it reads 256. It fixed the brief component's call, not yet committed, the interface tests passing, and noted the engine dropped the extra argument without a word, against nothing failing silently, proposing such a call be refused."]},"id":"1M82PVMBDV7W000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["On words, grounding itself in the sessions, it found the author never asked for them: at 2/6 he spoke of sentences' and words' relationships and locality, which the second session read as holons down to the word, its own path; at 8/32 a session held that the words stay holons for fidelity; at 8/33 the author settled only that a term is a holon made on purpose; at 15/37 he said word based holons were not needed; and Knowledge stated words as holons unmarked. It changed nothing about prose, and put the level, sentence or paragraph, to the author, noting it changes what a commit and a diff touch and what can be pointed at; and it asked to commit and publish the fix."]},"id":"1M82PVMBDV7W001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
